{"id": "1544589478642061412", "channel_id": "1543936698323574874", "author_id": "176908252141846528", "author_name": "kaveguy", "content": "1-4 I completely agree, but 5 and 6 lost me. Varied boss and enemy mechanics make the game more interesting, precisely because it limits the characters and strategies you can use on a given level. If every character can beat every level with enough investment, what is even the point of having different strategies? However I agree with your core point that D-Tide difficulty was completely broken by this patch", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T06:07:08.793000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1543936698323574874", "mentions": ["1537246559547166760"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "☝️", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "reply_to": "1544481092462051399", "thread_title": "V2.6.0.3 在线维护公告", "forum_channel_id": "1181135756958371881"}
{"id": "1544639544710795345", "channel_id": "1543936698323574874", "author_id": "767877714479808524", "author_name": "derp1489", "content": "This is a gacha game, not a single player game. If the unit you’ve spent hundreds of dollars on can’t clear contents and is hard countered everywhere, it feels bad. “Just find another unit to spend hundreds of dollars on” is not really a valid point.", "timestamp": "2026-09-02T09:26:05.474000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1543936698323574874", "mentions": ["176908252141846528"], "reply_to": "1544589478642061412", "thread_title": "V2.6.0.3 在线维护公告", "forum_channel_id": "1181135756958371881"}
